# Canonical authorship.
#
# This repository has one living contributor. Commits landed under agent-run
# identities (`Proteus Test`, `Proteus`), under a malformed noreply address git
# never validated, and under a second personal address. None of them is a
# separate person.
#
# `.mailmap` corrects every git tool's view — `log`, `shortlog`, `blame`, `-an`,
# and forge UIs that honour it — with NO history rewrite, so no hash changes and
# no push protection is involved. GitHub's own contributor sidebar is computed
# from raw commit headers and does NOT read this file; only a rebase and a
# force-push would change that, which is a separate, deliberate decision.

